# Architecture (MVC adapted for Next.js)

| Layer | Responsibility | Location |
|---|---|---|
| **Model** | Domain types, Zod schemas, persistence shapes | `src/models/`, `src/lib/schemas/` |
| **View** | Presentational UI only — no fetch, no business rules | `src/components/`, `src/app/**/page.tsx` |
| **Controller** | HTTP / server actions: validate input, call services, map response | `src/app/api/`, `src/app/actions/` |
| **Service** | Business logic, agent orchestration, Orbio calls | `src/services/` |

## Rules

- Views never call OpenRouter or touch secrets
- Controllers never embed prompt logic or verification algorithms — delegate to services
- Services never import React components
- Shared UI primitives live in `src/components/ui/`; feature UI in `src/components/{feature}/`
- Keep domain types in models; do not duplicate shapes across layers — import from models

```
❌ page.tsx → fetch OpenRouter directly
✅ page → action/API → VerificationService → OpenRouter client
```
